    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "今天有一大半的时间<br>\n都消耗在和看守捉迷藏上面了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（还好没被抓到，<br>\n　累死了……）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema001"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 25, "indent": 0, "params": {"DissolveTexturePath": "VerticalBlindGradually", "TintColor": "#000000", "Duration": 0.8999999761581421, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "2_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 29, "indent": 0, "params": {"DissolveTexturePath": "VerticalBlindGradually", "Duration": 0.8999999761581421, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.9"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛晃悠悠地走出房门外。<br>\n然后，碰见了梅露露。她好像一直站在门外等艾玛。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Meruru.Default"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛小姐，你没事吧？<br>\n我、我听说你刚刚被看守追赶……", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Meruru001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Meruru.Default"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 39, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 41, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗯，没事。我还好啦。<br>\n就是有些累了。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 43, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你的脸弄脏了。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Meruru002"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 45, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "梅露露满脸写着担心，<br>\n拿出手帕擦着艾玛的脸。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（感觉她好像妈妈一样）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛有点害羞地<br>\n低下了头。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "之后，梅露露走到<br>\n放在过道转弯处的水桶那边。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "那个桶应该是打扫的时候用的，<br>\n不过现在已经成了囚犯们的垃圾桶。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "梅露露准备把手帕丢掉。<br>\n可是在看到桶里的东西后，她感到有些奇怪。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Meruru.Pensive"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这是什么？", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Meruru003"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 64, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 65, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [-4.0, -3.0], "Zoom": 0.699999988079071, "EasingTypeName": "SmoothStep", "Duration": 0.8999999761581421, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 66, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.9"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛也走过来，看了一下桶里的东西。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 70, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "原来是一些拆得十分零碎的，像机械零件一样的东西<br>\n塞满了整个垃圾桶。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 73, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [0.0, 0.0], "Zoom": 0.0, "EasingTypeName": "SmoothStep", "Duration": 0.8999999761581421, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 74, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.9"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Meruru.Pensive"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 77, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 79, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我也不知道欸？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 81, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "过道本来就不太干净。<br>\n可能是有人打扫了一下，把垃圾倒进这里面了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 83, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 85, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（多想也是白费力气。<br>\n　这里到处都是怪事）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema005"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 87, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Meruru.Pensive"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 89, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛叹了一口气。<br>\n这时，梅露露轻轻牵起了她的手。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative011"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 91, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "QuickSave", "line": 92, "indent": 0, "params": {"SlotNumber": 6, "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 94, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我们去吃晚餐吧。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Meruru004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 96, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 98, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗯。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 100, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "面对温柔相待的梅露露，<br>\n艾玛露出了微笑。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 102, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊，我想起一件事。<br>\n你等我一下哦。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema007"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 104, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 106, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛她——", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative013"]}},
    {"op": "AddChoice", "line": 114, "indent": 0, "params": {"ChoiceSummary": "往诺亚的房间内探看", "Lock": 0, "AutoPlay": 1, "ShowHandler": 1}, "text_ids": {"ChoiceSummary": ["0101Adv19_Choice001"]}},
    {"op": "GotoModified", "line": 115, "indent": 1, "params": {"Path": ".Choice1-1-6"}},
    {"op": "AddChoice", "line": 117, "indent": 0, "params": {"ChoiceSummary": "摇摇头说：算了没什么", "Lock": 0, "ButtonPath": "ChoiceButtons/Adv/Bad", "AutoPlay": 1, "ShowHandler": 1}, "text_ids": {"ChoiceSummary": ["0101Adv19_Choice002"]}},
    {"op": "GotoModified", "line": 118, "indent": 1, "params": {"Path": "Act01_Chapter01/Act01_Chapter01_Bad06", "ResetState": ["-"]}},
    {"op": "StopForChoice", "line": 120, "indent": 0, "params": {"Clear": 0}},
    {"op": "label", "name": "Choice1-1-6", "line": 122, "indent": 0},
    {"op": "RecordCorrectChoice", "line": 124, "indent": 0, "params": {"Number": 6}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 126, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "一如往常地，往诺亚的房间里看了看。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative014"]}},
    {"op": "AnimateActorExtended", "line": 128, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["MainBackground"], "Loop": 0}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 129, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "MaskingRectangle", "Params": ["200", "200", "true", "0.5", "#000000cc"], "ScenePosition": [-7.0, 50.0], "Rotation": [0.0, 0.0, -10.0], "SubId": "Front"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 130, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": [1.5], "TintColor": "#00ffff", "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [10.0, 80.0], "AppearanceAndTransition": "1_1", "SubId": "Front"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 131, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": [1.149999976158142], "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [25.0, 45.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Noah.Normal1", "SubId": "Front"}},
    {"op": "ChangeActorMaskability", "line": 132, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["MainBackground-Front", "Noah-Front"], "Enable": 1}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 133, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000", "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 134, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.3"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 136, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "诺亚的房间也是老样子，<br>\n满满当当涂满了喷漆画。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative015"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 138, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 140, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "诺亚，今天你还是不去用餐吗？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema008"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 142, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [25.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Noah.Normal1", "SubId": "Front"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 144, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊，艾玛，梅露露。<br>\n诺亚没事哦？大家都对诺亚很好。", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Noah001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 146, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 148, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "大家？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 150, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [25.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Noah.Normal1", "SubId": "Front"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 152, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗯。她们有时会给诺亚送饭，<br>\n有时会陪诺亚聊天。", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Noah002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 154, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "虽然看到诺亚的魔法，大家有点吃惊……<br>\n不过，这里神奇的事情太多了。", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Noah003"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 156, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [25.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Noah.Flushed1", "SubId": "Front"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 158, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "大家也不害怕诺亚的魔法。<br>\n欸嘿嘿，好开心。", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Noah004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 160, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 162, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（哦……大家其实还<br>\n　挺关心诺亚的情况的）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 164, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "那就好。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema011"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 166, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [25.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Noah.Smile1", "SubId": "Front"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 168, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗯。为了报答大家，诺亚要加油画完这幅画。<br>\n大家看到一定会喜欢。", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Noah005"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 174, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_15", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 176, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "诺亚转过身，继续喷着手上的喷漆。<br>\n刺鼻的气味传到了正要离开的艾玛的鼻子里。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative016"]}},
    {"op": "HideActors", "line": 178, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["Noah-Front", "MainBackground-Front"], "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 179, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "MaskingRectangle", "SubId": "Front", "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 180, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Surprised1", "SubId": "Middle"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 181, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.3"}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 183, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 184, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 185, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Meruru.Default"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 187, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……对了，安安她<br>\n和诺亚相处得怎么样了？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 189, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "走上楼梯时，<br>\n艾玛向梅露露问道。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative017"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 191, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "该怎么说呢……虽然昨晚安安回房了，<br>\n可是到了今天，身体情况又变差了，现在还在医务室里躺着。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Meruru005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 193, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "好像待在同一间房里实在很难受……", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Meruru006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 195, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "唔，这样啊……有没有什么好方法呢。<br>\n有了，和我换一个房间，怎么样！", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema013"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 197, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Meruru.Smile"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 199, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "是个好办法！", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Meruru007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 201, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（马上去商量一下吧……<br>\n　下次碰到典狱长也要说一下……）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Ema014"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 203, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 205, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛和梅露露走上了楼梯。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv19_Narrative018"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 211, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_7", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
